562 0 obj
  << /ActualText (If the nozzle offset calibration does not resolve the issue\054 measure the deviation between the plastic and the fiber\054 and adjust the offset value accordingly\056 Using the machine zero point as the reference\072 if the plastic is overall to the right\054 decrease the X offset value\073 if the plastic is overall upward\054 decrease the Y offset value\056 The specific amount to increase or decrease is equal to the actual model offset\054 in millimeters\056 For example\054 if the plastic is offset to the right by 2 mm\054 and the current X offset value is \05532\05655\054 the adjusted X offset value shall be \05534\05655\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 563 0 R
     /Pg 540 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

